<title>HONG KONG: Far East Holdings H1 net returns to gain.</title>
<headline>Far East Holdings H1 net returns to gain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.81 gain   vs 8.23 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	   vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  27.87 gain  vs 28.11 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    5.41 profit vs 24.57 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     227.54	vs 76.42</p>
<p>    Company name		 Far East Holdings International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Far East Holdings engages in property investment, cinema operation and leisure-related businesses.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on the write-back of provisions for diminution in value of listed securities.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
